9cC68abdaf8" style=3D"text-decoration: underline; color: #006699;">as Matt =
Lambert, a medical doctor and author</a>. He was allegedly motivated by a r=
ow about mould in his apartment building. Lambert was later found dead by p=
olice with a self-inflicted gunshot wound.</p><p=20
style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p><p sty=
le=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px">
<strong>What happened on Thursday morning?&nbsp;</strong>Lambert <a href=3D=
"https://link.thetimes.com/click/48411662.445310/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cudGhldGltZX=
MuY29tL3VzL25ld3MtdG9kYXkvYXJ0aWNsZS93YXNoaW5ndG9uLWRjLXNob290aW5nLXdoYXQta=
GFwcGVuZWQtbG9nYW4tY2lyY2xlLW1hdHQtbGFtYmVydC16Y2duc3BkZHI/6a464fcf7d55e1fc=
fb02eb9cCf1253968" target=3D"_blank" style=3D"text-decoration: underline; c=
olor: #006699;" rel=3D"noopener">allegedly opened fire at the Vida Fitness =
gym in Logan Circle</a> at about 8am. One person was killed and four others=
 were injured. He allegedly walked through the packed gym, heading for his =
intended victim, and shot dead a man in an execution-style hit. The victim =
was named on Thursday afternoon as James Stuart, 46, who worked at EJF Real=
 Estate Services, which managed the Metropole condominiums where Lambert li=
ved.
</p><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p=
><p style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:27px">After carryi=
ng out the shooting, the suspect then barricaded himself inside his apartme=
nt, seven floors above the gym. He was found dead just before 11am.&nbsp;</=
p><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"margin:0;mso-line-height-alt:21px">&nbsp;</p><p d=
ir=3D"ltr" style=3D"margin:0;mso-line-height-alt:27px">
<span style=3D"word-break: break-word; font-size: 18px;"><strong>Do we know=
 the motive?</strong> No motive has been determined yet, but police suspect=
 that Lambert was in a dispute with the homeowners=E2=80=99 association of =
